	measure 'Column Color' = ```
			
			VAR CurrentVal = [Average Order Value]
			VAR MaxVal = 
			    CALCULATE(
			        MAXX(
			            ALLSELECTED(Fact_Sales[Discount Group]), 
			            [Average Order Value]
			        ),
			        ALLSELECTED()
			    )
			RETURN
			    IF(CurrentVal = MaxVal, "#009696", "#2E4057")
			```
		displayFolder: 03_Formatting & Colors
